## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** GLM 4.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Z.ai's high-speed free-tier lightweight 4.5-generation model with a 128K window, dual thinking modes and agentic tool execution; a distinct Flash route, not the 355B-A32B flagship.
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai developer platform (free tier) and OpenCode Zen (`opencode/glm-4.5-flash`), OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions.
- **Release / knowledge:** GLM-4.5 generation (2025); exact Flash release date not published in the sources found.
- **IDs:** `glm-4.5-flash`, `opencode/glm-4.5-flash`.
- **Context window:** 128K total; up to 98K max output (Z.ai docs / curated metadata).
- **Modalities:** text in/out; interleaved thinking; tool calling.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-23):** Free — $0.00/$0.00 in/out on the Z.ai Flash tier and Zen.
- **Architecture:** distilled lightweight 4.5-generation model; proprietary endpoint.

