### Why the file is excluded (evidence trail)

- Z.ai's GLM-4.5 launch post and arXiv paper (2508.06471) report GLM-4.5 and GLM-4.5-Air rows only: GPQA 79.1/75.0, HLE 14.4/10.6, LiveCodeBench 72.9/70.7, SWE-bench Verified 64.2/57.6. No Flash row exists.
- Searches across BenchLM, Vals AI, llm-stats and the Z.ai docs surfaced pricing/context for `glm-4.5-flash` but no benchmark table.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` / `.agents/rules.md`, zero verified numbers for the exact tier means self-exclusion; flagship figures are not silently merged.
- Re-research trigger: a dated Flash-specific benchmark → write a scored `DeepSeek_4.1_Flash.md` and retire this twin (`RULES.md` twin rule).

